        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>05 / 现代的剧场</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .top {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    padding: 14px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .col-left {\n    width: 262px;\n    padding: 0 24px 0 22px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    width: 1px;\n    background: #6a6a6a;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n  .col-right {\n    width: 277px;\n    padding: 0 26px 0 20px;\n  }\n\n  /* Left column quote block */\n  .quote-block {\n    margin-top: 88px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .quote-mark {\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #111;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin-left: 4px;\n  }\n  .quote-text {\n    font-size: 6.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    text-align: justify;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n    text-indent: 12px;\n  }\n  .quote-end {\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    vertical-align: -2px;\n  }\n\n  /* Left column image placeholder */\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #dcdee0;\n    border: 1px solid #b9bcc0;\n    color: #4a4d51;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n  .ph-left {\n    width: 205px;\n    height: 133px;\n    margin: 82px 0 0 12px;\n  }\n\n  /* Right column */\n  .section-num {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    margin: 0 0 22px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .col-right p.body {\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 1.95;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n  }\n\n  /* Bottom full-width image */\n  .ph-bottom {\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 219px;\n    margin: 14px 0 0 0;\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px solid #b9bcc0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <div class=\"quote-block\">\n        <div class=\"quote-mark\">&ldquo;</div>\n        <div class=\"quote-text\">\n          剧场的绝对魅力存于它的现场性；它的诡谲在于它是生命短暂与无常的缩影。在剧场短暂的那一刹那中，演员和观众同时知道，他们彼此经历的共同经验是唯一的。灯暗、幕落，即使是同一个剧团，同一个剧本，同一个演员阵容，同一场演出永远不会再重现。<span class=\"quote-end\">&rdquo;</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <figure class=\"placeholder ph-left\">\n        [Photo: night view of theater festival building with portrait banner, \"aranya theater festival\" signage — left column, lower half]\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <div class=\"section-num\">05/</div>\n      <div class=\"section-title\">现代的剧场</div>\n\n      <p class=\"body\">波德莱尔说：“现代性就是过度、短暂、偶然，就是艺术的一半，另一半是永恒和不变”。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"body\">美既可能存在于永恒中，也可能存在于短暂中，脚手架就是短暂存在的样本之一，在城市中发挥着它的灵活性、便捷性和临时性。戏剧也是短暂存在的样本之一，具有限时性和现场性。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"body\">我们用脚手架搭建“聚场”，与“剧场”不同的是，这里没有聚光灯，灯源分散各处，没有可供行动的舞台，只有临时构建的通道，没有舞者和演员，只有汇聚的人群和威严的巨匠头像，这里仿佛和戏剧有关，又仿佛和戏剧无关，戏剧便是“聚场”的本质，一切的筑造围绕着它生长、裂变、演进、蔓延，而所谓的本质，站立着的是偶然和机遇，是后来者的想象和解读。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"body\">这便是现代的剧场，在短暂的潮汐聚合中，传递着向自身收缩、合拢、集结、凝聚的外在事物表达，还有梦境与现实的带来的深刻意蕴。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <figure class=\"placeholder ph-bottom\">\n    [Photo: full-width panorama — life-size black-and-white cutout portraits of figures (including Salvador Dalí and Albert Einstein) standing behind transparent panels in an exhibition space]\n  </figure>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
